{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ReactiveX/RxJava/issues/1791","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ReactiveX/RxJava","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ReactiveX/RxJava/issues/1791/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ReactiveX/RxJava/issues/1791/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ReactiveX/RxJava/issues/1791/events","html_url":"https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/issues/1791","id":46659229,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWU0NjY1OTIyOQ==","number":1791,"title":"Observable#first causes retryWhen to trigger retry without an exception","user":{"login":"alexwen","id":363738,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzczOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/363738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexwen","html_url":"https://github.com/alexwen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexwen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexwen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexwen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexwen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexwen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexwen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexwen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexwen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/alexwen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":24234451,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNDIzNDQ1MQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ReactiveX/RxJava/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"fc2929","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ReactiveX/RxJava/milestones/2","html_url":"https://github.com/ReactiveX/RxJava/milestone/2","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ReactiveX/RxJava/milestones/2/labels","id":245955,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMjQ1OTU1","number":2,"title":"1.0","description":"Requirements to ship 1.0.0 Final.\r\n\r\nThis will include anything related to signature and public API changes as once 1.0 Final ships they can no longer change. Any critical bugs and other opportunistic improvements will also be done here.\r\n\r\nAnything non-critical that does not affect the public APIs can go into 1.0.x or 1.x.","creator":{"login":"benjchristensen","id":813492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMzQ5Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/813492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjchristensen","html_url":"https://github.com/benjchristensen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjchristensen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjchristensen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjchristensen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjchristensen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjchristensen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjchristensen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjchristensen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjchristensen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjchristensen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":68,"state":"closed","created_at":"2013-01-16T21:54:14Z","updated_at":"2014-11-19T07:03:16Z","due_on":"2014-11-18T08:00:00Z","closed_at":"2014-11-19T07:03:16Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2014-10-23T18:28:16Z","updated_at":"2014-10-23T21:49:35Z","closed_at":"2014-10-23T21:48:27Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Noticed this behavior using rx-netty as internally it does a take(1) internally:\n\n```\n    AtomicLong inc = new AtomicLong(0);\n    Observable.OnSubscribe<Long> onSubscribe = subscriber -> {\n        final long emit = inc.getAndIncrement();\n        LOGGER.info(\"Emitting: {}\", emit);\n        subscriber.onNext(emit);\n        subscriber.onCompleted();\n    };\n\n    LOGGER.info(\"DONE: {}\", Observable.create(onSubscribe)\n                    .retryWhen(attempt -> attempt.zipWith(Observable.range(1, 4), (n, i) -> i))\n                    .toBlocking()\n                    .first()\n    );\n```\n\nThe test output is:\n    Emitting: 0\n    Emitting: 1\n    DONE: 0\n\nAs you can see the observable is subscribed to twice. This is because take, in combination with single, causes the retryWhen producer to request another item.\n","closed_by":{"login":"benjchristensen","id":813492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMzQ5Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/813492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjchristensen","html_url":"https://github.com/benjchristensen","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjchristensen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjchristensen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjchristensen/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjchristensen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjchristensen/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjchristensen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjchristensen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjchristensen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benjchristensen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ReactiveX/RxJava/issues/1791/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray"